# Naming Conventions

## Files & Folders
```
kebab-case/
├── tutor-profile.tsx       # Components
├── use-booking.ts          # Hooks (use- prefix)
├── booking.service.ts      # Services (optional .service suffix)
└── create-booking.schema.ts
```

## Functions & Variables
```typescript
// camelCase for functions/variables
const currentUser = await getAuthUser();
const isAvailable = checkTutorAvailability(tutorId, timeSlot);

// PascalCase for components/classes/types
function TutorProfile({ tutor }: TutorProfileProps) {}
type BookingStatus = "pending" | "confirmed" | "cancelled";

// SCREAMING_SNAKE for constants
const MAX_SESSION_DURATION = 180;
const BOOKING_STATUS = { PENDING: "pending", CONFIRMED: "confirmed" } as const;
```

## API Endpoints
```
/api/tutors              GET    - list
/api/tutors/:id          GET    - get one
/api/tutors              POST   - create
/api/tutors/:id          PATCH  - update
/api/tutors/:id          DELETE - delete
/api/tutors/:id/sessions GET    - nested resource
```

## Database
```sql
-- snake_case for tables and columns
CREATE TABLE bookings (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  tutor_id UUID REFERENCES tutors(id),
  student_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
  start_time TIMESTAMPTZ,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);
```

## Events & Actions
```typescript
// verb:noun pattern
"booking:created"
"tutor:matched"
"session:started"
```
